# Sync to Local WordPress

After making changes in this repo, copy them to the local WordPress plugin directory:

**Source:** `C:\Users\mattc\OneDrive\Desktop\School\CSE199R\AmbrosiaSweetDesk`
**Target:** `C:\Users\mattc\Local Sites\cse-199r-site\app\public\wp-content\plugins\AmbrosiaSweetDesk`

Use robocopy (exclude `.git`, `node_modules`, `.cursor`):

```powershell
robocopy "C:\Users\mattc\OneDrive\Desktop\School\CSE199R\AmbrosiaSweetDesk" "C:\Users\mattc\Local Sites\cse-199r-site\app\public\wp-content\plugins\AmbrosiaSweetDesk" /E /XD .git node_modules .cursor /NFL /NDL /NJH /NJS /nc /ns /np
```

Do this at the end of implementation work unless the user says otherwise.
